Signed-off-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>



From e1badfeee4fa8f8fa4464e4079beedb7e686bba8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:07:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3585/3586] dt-bindings: display: rockchip,dw-hdmi: Add RK3528
 compatible

The RK3528 has a Synopsys DesignWare HDMI 2.0 TX controller with an
Innosilicon HDMI PHY, like the RK3328.

On RK3528 the hot plug detect pin (GPIO0_A2) is sensed as a GPIO and the
HPD state is forwarded to the controller through the VO GRF, so allow an
optional hpd-gpios property for it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../display/rockchip/rockchip,dw-hdmi.yaml       | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip,dw-hdmi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip,dw-hdmi.yaml
index 2971676..a15c166 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip,dw-hdmi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip,dw-hdmi.yaml
@@ -16,6 +16,15 @@ description: |
 allOf:
   - $ref: ../bridge/synopsys,dw-hdmi.yaml#
   - $ref: /schemas/sound/dai-common.yaml#
+  - if:
+      not:
+        properties:
+          compatible:
+            contains:
+              const: rockchip,rk3528-dw-hdmi
+    then:
+      properties:
+        hpd-gpios: false
 
 properties:
   compatible:
@@ -25,6 +34,7 @@ properties:
       - rockchip,rk3328-dw-hdmi
       - rockchip,rk3368-dw-hdmi
       - rockchip,rk3399-dw-hdmi
+      - rockchip,rk3528-dw-hdmi
       - rockchip,rk3568-dw-hdmi
 
   reg-io-width:
@@ -71,6 +81,12 @@ properties:
           - vpll
           - ref
 
+  hpd-gpios:
+    maxItems: 1
+    description:
+      GPIO used to sense the hot plug detect signal. On RK3528 the HPD state
+      is forwarded by software to the HDMI controller through the VO GRF.
+
   phys:
     maxItems: 1
     description: The HDMI PHY
-- 
